{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TEKO is an Indie Roguelike Deckbuilder where you have to reach the highest possible score by playing Poker hands, but in an unconventional way: making 3 combos at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every chip played counts! You won\u2019t waste a single hand. Create your own strategies: each one offers a different way to win your runs. As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new ways to multiply your score and push your limits even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/bf6d5104bd5dc7de5d89ef36ab6d55f0.poster.avif?t=1768646080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/bf6d5104bd5dc7de5d89ef36ab6d55f0.webm?t=1768646080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/bf6d5104bd5dc7de5d89ef36ab6d55f0.mp4?t=1768646080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your Pocket, delete Chips, buy Consumables, bet to earn more MONEY, gain perks for playing better, take risks, choose whether to save or spend it all, fight bosses, surpass the imposed limits, and pick the strategy that best fits what you find in the Shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/c041861d754b70ace8670a0cd0f6727a.poster.avif?t=1768646080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/c041861d754b70ace8670a0cd0f6727a.webm?t=1768646080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/c041861d754b70ace8670a0cd0f6727a.mp4?t=1768646080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single correct way to play this. Break the game, dare to try new things. Everything you do will add to your final score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/a7f5d7b2a32f86a15c4512702c3797a6.poster.avif?t=1768646080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/a7f5d7b2a32f86a15c4512702c3797a6.webm?t=1768646080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/a7f5d7b2a32f86a15c4512702c3797a6.mp4?t=1768646080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tons of available combinations, amazing interactions, and dozens of items that will let you create your ideal Build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/965aa0acdbe0d9b4c1d837688c77ba67.webp?t=1768646080\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/extras/965aa0acdbe0d9b4c1d837688c77ba67.poster.avif?t=1768646080\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835670?t=1768646080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/b3a62ff6e9d94b974b0f33497854307ee6ca9d67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768646080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835670/ead9365371bf34f6ea15a556ce6b0e14ea96a677/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768646080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s